        "content": "<p>afonso360 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14071\">PR #14071</a> from <code>afonso360:riscv64-f16-conversion</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> Hey,</p>\n<p>This PR implements f16&lt;-&gt;f32,f64 instructions for the riscv64 backend. These instructions are defined in <code>Zfhmin</code> as subset of the main f16 extension <code>Zfh</code>.</p>\n<p><code>Zfhmin</code> is the minimal support for f16 package that implements pretty much just conversion, load and store instructions.</p>\n</blockquote>",
